# Index artifact of the semantic engine: the two builds and the check of the ids.
# Date: 2026-11-21. Context: POC account us-east-1, Titan Text Embeddings V2, 98 local demo profiles.
# Script: loop8/engine/scripts/build-index.ts, hand run. The artifact is loop8/internal/index-artifact.json (not in the repository).

### P1 First build, output saved when it ran (index bda903154e95230e)
$ node loop8/engine/.local-dist/build-index.mjs
Loaded 98 demo profiles, 964 fragments.
Embedded: 964 new, 0 reused from the prior artifact.
Wrote <repo>/loop8/internal/index-artifact.json (index bda903154e95230e, 964 vectors).
Titan usage this run: 964 calls, 42765 input tokens.
RESULT: 964 fragments embedded with 964 Titan calls and 42765 input tokens. The ids of six profiles were slugs.

